WEBVTT

00:02.650 --> 00:05.440
I wonder what's going on back in Zoltan.

00:05.440 --> 00:08.980
Tisse should send word as 
soon as the airship is found.

00:09.690 --> 00:12.110
I guess they're having trouble finding it.

00:12.110 --> 00:15.990
Maybe we should've left a big 
arrow pointing to its location.

00:16.470 --> 00:17.280
Yeah.

00:28.060 --> 00:33.510
Flowers can't move, so the bees 
carry the pollen for them, huh?

00:33.780 --> 00:34.580
Yeah.

00:34.990 --> 00:38.600
The bees are just gathering 
food for themselves,

00:38.600 --> 00:40.880
but without them, the flowers can't bloom.

00:41.400 --> 00:42.520
And it's not just the flowers.

00:42.850 --> 00:46.770
The vegetables in this village 
only grow because of them, too.

00:47.210 --> 00:49.000
It's amazing.

00:49.000 --> 00:51.780
They're doing something for themselves,

00:51.780 --> 00:55.890
but it helps the flowers and us, too.

00:57.250 --> 01:01.320
One! Two! Three!

01:01.320 --> 01:02.320
Four!

01:02.320 --> 01:03.360
Whoa!

01:03.360 --> 01:04.790
What's wrong with you?

01:06.140 --> 01:07.490
What are they doing?

01:07.490 --> 01:08.830
Wanna go see?

01:08.830 --> 01:09.510
Yep.

01:23.140 --> 01:29.850
<b>Banished from the Hero's Party,
I Decided to Live a Quiet Life in the Countryside 2nd</b>

02:40.670 --> 02:44.760
<b>The Two Heroes</b>

02:40.990 --> 02:45.790
One! Two! Three!

02:45.790 --> 02:49.150
Four! Five!

02:48.270 --> 02:50.480
Oh, so they're training in a group.

02:49.150 --> 02:52.590
Six! Seven!

02:50.480 --> 02:55.570
Even children need to fight to 
raise their Blessing levels.

02:52.590 --> 02:55.570
Eight! Nine!

02:55.570 --> 02:58.280
Oh, hello, Mister Red!

02:58.280 --> 02:59.690
Hey, there.

02:59.690 --> 03:04.330
You're the doctor who 
helped Miss Kate, right?

03:04.330 --> 03:07.830
Nah, I'm no doctor. I just run an apothecary.

03:08.120 --> 03:10.560
My dad called you a great guy!

03:10.560 --> 03:12.710
You must be a wizard.

03:12.710 --> 03:14.770
You're a hit with the kids, Big Brother.

03:14.770 --> 03:16.460
I feel like this is greatly exaggerated.

03:16.710 --> 03:19.670
I can supervise your training if you want.

03:19.670 --> 03:21.840
Really? Yay!

03:20.590 --> 03:21.840
Heck yeah!

03:23.840 --> 03:28.250
One! Two! Three!

03:27.790 --> 03:29.690
Keep your center of gravity low.

03:28.250 --> 03:33.100
Four! Five! Six!

03:29.690 --> 03:30.510
Like this?

03:30.510 --> 03:32.100
Yeah, that's the way.

03:32.100 --> 03:35.550
Rit is so good at breaking the ice.

03:33.100 --> 03:36.690
Seven! Eight!

03:35.550 --> 03:36.690
She sure is.

03:37.360 --> 03:38.650
One!

03:38.650 --> 03:41.110
Two! Three!

03:40.770 --> 03:42.770
You've got the basics down pat.

03:42.040 --> 03:45.400
Four! Five!

03:43.280 --> 03:46.420
You should move on to training 
with your Blessing in mind.

03:45.400 --> 03:47.990
Six! Seven!

03:46.420 --> 03:47.990
My Blessing?

03:48.240 --> 03:48.940
Yeah.

03:49.350 --> 03:51.870
You've got the Gladiator Blessing, right?

03:52.320 --> 03:55.510
It's a powerful Blessing that 
produces the very best adventurers.

03:55.510 --> 03:57.750
Wow! How did you know?

03:57.750 --> 04:00.480
Well, I did study a lot.

04:00.480 --> 04:02.480
You really are a wizard!

04:02.480 --> 04:05.460
How exactly do I train 
with my Blessing in mind?

04:05.460 --> 04:06.900
Yeah, well...

04:06.050 --> 04:08.380
Lucky him! Teach me, too!

04:08.380 --> 04:10.740
Okay, okay. But wait your turn.

04:10.740 --> 04:12.770
There you are, Red!

04:13.040 --> 04:15.530
Please head back to your cottage at once.

04:15.530 --> 04:18.480
An ogre king has been 
spotted near the village.

04:18.880 --> 04:20.230
An ogre king?

04:20.510 --> 04:21.560
Yes.

04:21.560 --> 04:24.550
They almost never enter the village itself,

04:24.550 --> 04:28.240
but a man who lived on the outskirts 
was once attacked in the past.

04:28.930 --> 04:31.110
We'll be going out to patrol now.

04:31.110 --> 04:34.740
Please stay inside until 
we can confirm it's safe.

04:34.740 --> 04:37.230
You kids run home, too.

04:37.230 --> 04:38.500
What...

04:39.160 --> 04:41.260
Do you want me to go check things out?

04:41.260 --> 04:44.760
O-Oh, no. I couldn't ask that of you.

04:44.760 --> 04:47.180
Believe it or not,
 I can fight when I need to.

04:57.650 --> 04:59.700
We're pretty strong.

05:00.410 --> 05:01.980
Do you understand now?

05:01.980 --> 05:04.030
You're awesome, miss!

05:04.030 --> 05:05.400
How'd you do that?!

05:05.400 --> 05:06.990
Teach me how!

05:06.990 --> 05:08.130
Whoa!

05:08.130 --> 05:09.210
That's cool!

05:09.210 --> 05:10.830
I wanna try it, too!

05:15.690 --> 05:18.710
We're not finding any signs 
of an ogre king's presence.

05:18.710 --> 05:21.900
Yeah. Maybe someone 
misunderstood what they saw.

05:21.900 --> 05:25.090
Sorry for dragging you two out. 
I just really wanted to help.

05:25.090 --> 05:27.870
I get it. Kids are great, huh?

05:27.870 --> 05:29.600
I would like to take ours on a walk someday.

05:29.880 --> 05:31.060
Sounds good.

05:31.060 --> 05:34.230
Big Brother, Rit, their kids, and me...

05:34.830 --> 05:36.440
That sounds fun.

05:37.570 --> 05:38.470
Red.

05:38.470 --> 05:39.940
Find something?

05:40.200 --> 05:41.280
Take a look.

05:46.350 --> 05:48.740
The grass is all crumpled.

05:48.740 --> 05:50.240
Tracks?

05:50.240 --> 05:55.250
Yeah. But it's choosing to walk on grass and 
stuff in order to avoid leaving footprints.

05:55.910 --> 05:59.910
What kind of ogre king is this intelligent?

06:05.740 --> 06:08.080
Okay, so we've got some bad news.

06:09.360 --> 06:11.690
There are at least 30 of them.

06:11.690 --> 06:13.920
They seem to be scouting the village.

06:13.920 --> 06:17.940
Scouting? Are ogre kings 
really capable of that?

06:17.940 --> 06:21.560
Yeah... These don't seem 
to be ordinary ogre kings.

06:21.560 --> 06:24.330
Rit and I will get rid of them.

06:24.330 --> 06:28.280
Everyone, please gather the rest of the 
villagers and get to a safe place.

06:30.620 --> 06:32.160
I'll keep you safe.

06:33.990 --> 06:37.170
Now that's reassuring! Thank you!

06:37.170 --> 06:39.750
Red, Rit, you two be careful, too.

06:39.750 --> 06:40.920
R-Right.

06:43.200 --> 06:45.800
You're really strong, miss.

06:46.210 --> 06:48.300
You've got the champion's Blessing, right?

06:49.230 --> 06:50.880
I won't answer that.

06:51.660 --> 06:53.300
But my Blessing has nothing to do with it.

06:54.450 --> 06:58.650
I'm protecting you all because I want to.

06:59.330 --> 07:03.040
I don't let my Blessing tell me what to do.

07:03.040 --> 07:05.990
I act of my own free will.

07:11.360 --> 07:12.570
Welcome.

07:13.540 --> 07:14.790
Hello.

07:14.790 --> 07:16.270
How are things looking?

07:16.270 --> 07:18.710
Nothing to report yet.

07:18.710 --> 07:23.000
But that Hero is far too unlike Miss Ruti.

07:23.280 --> 07:25.380
How so?

07:25.740 --> 07:28.220
Back when Miss Ruti was a Hero,

07:28.220 --> 07:33.270
her Blessing suppressed all her emotions.

07:33.270 --> 07:35.390
But Van the Hero is very expressive.

07:36.030 --> 07:38.770
And that makes me anxious.

07:39.180 --> 07:40.100
About what?

07:40.100 --> 07:44.600
Well, I don't know if handing over 
the airship is such a good idea.

07:44.600 --> 07:45.900
Huh...

07:46.670 --> 07:52.450
I'll continue to keep an eye on Van the 
Hero to see what kind of person he is.

07:52.910 --> 07:55.430
Got it. But be careful.

07:55.430 --> 07:56.080
I will.

07:56.560 --> 07:59.050
How are things here?

07:59.050 --> 08:02.250
Are you having any trouble 
running the apothecary?

08:02.630 --> 08:04.460
Well, that part's been fine.

08:07.140 --> 08:12.630
Thing is, the plants have been acting 
strange ever since Van the Hero arrived.

08:12.920 --> 08:17.140
They're all scared of some terrifying 
disaster that is drawing closer.

08:17.400 --> 08:20.110
Is this about Van the Hero?

08:20.110 --> 08:21.000
No.

08:24.900 --> 08:29.660
It appears something more nebulous 
has entered Zoltan with him.

08:32.020 --> 08:34.150
So that's Van the Hero.

08:34.150 --> 08:36.780
How nice of him to come all the way out here.

08:36.780 --> 08:39.180
We're so lucky!

08:41.950 --> 08:44.550
Yet another crowd of humans.

08:44.550 --> 08:46.610
They're such a nuisance.

08:46.610 --> 08:47.670
Boo!

08:47.970 --> 08:49.140
Stop it, Lavender.

08:49.650 --> 08:52.450
It's only natural for the people 
to take an interest in the Hero.

08:52.450 --> 08:54.380
Hmph! Nobody asked you, Esta!

08:54.650 --> 08:57.730
Anyway, what are we doing, Van? Sightseeing?

08:57.730 --> 08:58.590
No.

08:58.590 --> 09:02.640
As a Hero, I have to act according 
to the Almighty Demis's wishes.

09:03.130 --> 09:05.730
And what exactly does Demis want?

09:06.000 --> 09:08.320
That's what I'm trying to figure out.

09:10.540 --> 09:12.230
Eero!

09:15.490 --> 09:17.200
M-My apologies!

09:17.480 --> 09:21.590
You're bothering the Hero by 
clinging to him like that.

09:22.500 --> 09:23.410
Van.

09:24.550 --> 09:25.570
Hello.

09:27.550 --> 09:29.290
Thank you.

09:29.950 --> 09:31.300
Lucky him.

09:31.710 --> 09:34.400
I wanna talk to the Hero, too.

09:34.400 --> 09:36.160
Me, too!

09:36.160 --> 09:39.270
These are all children living at the church.

09:39.880 --> 09:41.010
At the church?

09:41.010 --> 09:44.440
Yes. And I help take care of them.

09:44.440 --> 09:46.750
I know it's forward of me to ask,

09:46.750 --> 09:50.520
but could you talk to these kids for a bit?

09:50.520 --> 09:52.000
Sorry, but we're...

09:52.000 --> 09:53.570
I don't mind.

09:53.570 --> 09:55.100
What?!

09:55.100 --> 09:56.450
Are you sure, Van?

09:56.700 --> 09:59.070
Yes. As long as it doesn't take too long.

09:59.070 --> 10:01.580
Th-Thank you so much.

10:04.880 --> 10:08.580
Thank you for granting the children's wish.

10:08.580 --> 10:11.950
You are too kind.

10:11.950 --> 10:14.920
I heard that these children live here.

10:15.150 --> 10:16.150
That's right.

10:16.150 --> 10:22.190
Children separated from their parents for 
various reasons have a new home here.

10:22.190 --> 10:26.550
The former mayor Mistorm and 
I support their lives here.

10:26.550 --> 10:28.570
Welcome, Sir Hero.

10:28.570 --> 10:31.900
I extend my deepest gratitude to you, too.

10:32.400 --> 10:36.900
I would also like to offer my help to 
make these kids' lives a little better.

10:37.180 --> 10:38.970
Thank you.

10:38.970 --> 10:42.910
Tanta, show them to the rooms, would you?

10:42.910 --> 10:43.970
Sure.

10:43.970 --> 10:45.320
This way, please.

10:45.830 --> 10:48.710
Hero, tell us about your adventures!

10:48.710 --> 10:49.930
I wanna know, too!

10:49.930 --> 10:50.890
Same!

10:50.890 --> 10:51.830
Me, too!

10:52.110 --> 10:52.830
Sure.

10:52.830 --> 10:54.710
Yay!

10:54.710 --> 10:57.130
Hey! Keep your paws off Van!

10:59.550 --> 11:04.050
I haven't seen the children 
that happy for a while.

11:04.050 --> 11:07.440
The Hero is a very kind boy.

11:07.440 --> 11:09.530
If only he were like that all the time.

11:10.000 --> 11:13.610
You've heard what happened 
at the welcoming party, yes?

11:13.610 --> 11:15.140
Bits and pieces, I suppose.

11:15.680 --> 11:18.480
That was rude to everyone there.

11:18.480 --> 11:20.480
Please allow me to apologize.

11:21.400 --> 11:23.330
Van is an innocent boy.

11:23.330 --> 11:26.900
And that innocence has unfortunately 
made him blind to people.

11:26.900 --> 11:28.330
Or so I thought.

11:28.820 --> 11:31.790
But he seems to be gentle with children.

11:31.790 --> 11:32.530
Indeed.

11:36.510 --> 11:40.720
So, what kind of places have you been to?

11:40.720 --> 11:43.120
Have you fought any scary monsters?

11:43.120 --> 11:43.760
Yeah.

11:44.170 --> 11:47.530
I've been to various places 
and fought all kinds of foes.

11:48.110 --> 11:50.730
My last battle was against an evil dragon.

11:50.730 --> 11:52.960
What? You fought a dragon?!

11:52.960 --> 11:54.230
Weren't you scared?

11:54.700 --> 11:58.210
A Hero fears nothing.

11:58.760 --> 12:02.280
No matter how formidable the foe, 
no matter how dire the situation,

12:02.280 --> 12:05.740
it's a Hero's job to fight 
valiantly and never give up.

12:06.080 --> 12:08.620
I want to go on adventures with you!

12:08.620 --> 12:11.930
Huh? There's no way!

12:11.930 --> 12:14.250
Have any of you awakened your Blessing yet?

12:16.860 --> 12:17.700
I see.

12:18.160 --> 12:23.130
You can't decide how to live your life 
until you know what Blessing you have.

12:23.130 --> 12:25.770
What? But Tanta's decided already.

12:25.770 --> 12:27.690
He's gonna be a carpenter!

12:28.720 --> 12:30.020
Is that so?

12:30.240 --> 12:34.940
Yes. I hope I receive a 
Blessing that helps with work.

12:35.590 --> 12:38.190
That is for Lord Demis to decide.

12:38.720 --> 12:42.820
You may even receive a Blessing 
that can make you a champion.

12:42.820 --> 12:44.810
Me? A champion?

12:44.810 --> 12:48.000
I'd never thought about that.

12:48.000 --> 12:50.880
But even if I did receive such a Blessing,

12:50.880 --> 12:53.330
I'd still want to be a carpenter.

12:53.750 --> 12:58.450
I want to build comfortable, 
safe homes and bring joy to all!

12:58.450 --> 12:59.580
Joy?

12:59.960 --> 13:01.020
Yes!

13:01.020 --> 13:06.010
You eat with your family, take a relaxing bath, 
and sleep in a comfortable bed.

13:06.010 --> 13:08.970
Those are the greatest joys 
in life, don't you think?

13:09.200 --> 13:10.850
That's wrong.

13:10.850 --> 13:13.650
What you're talking about isn't joy.

13:14.230 --> 13:15.830
It's decadence.

13:15.830 --> 13:17.480
D-Decadence?

13:19.090 --> 13:22.700
True joy is only obtained by living 
in accordance with your Blessing.

13:23.150 --> 13:27.750
Such is the will of Lord Demis, 
the almighty creator.

13:32.890 --> 13:34.010
I see now.

13:36.010 --> 13:38.440
Talking with you helped me understand.

13:39.000 --> 13:41.640
I know now what I must do,

13:41.640 --> 13:44.320
and that's change the mindset 
of the people in Zoltan.

13:44.320 --> 13:47.400
That is my duty as the Hero.

13:49.920 --> 13:53.460
They're really good at covering their tracks.

13:53.460 --> 13:55.940
These are no ordinary ogre kings.

13:55.940 --> 13:57.980
Yeah, we'll have to stay on our toes.

13:58.430 --> 14:03.120
But if we can't deal with them, 
Zoltan will hear about it.

14:03.120 --> 14:06.370
And then the Hero, who is incapable 
of ignoring people in need,

14:06.370 --> 14:07.990
will likely come to this village.

14:08.590 --> 14:10.320
That would be bad.

14:17.000 --> 14:19.360
I smell beasts. They're close.

14:19.360 --> 14:20.110
Yeah.

14:27.780 --> 14:29.470
We can beat them no problem.

14:29.930 --> 14:32.810
But that one certainly felt unusual.

14:32.810 --> 14:36.390
Yeah. I've never seen an 
ogre king use a weapon before.

14:36.770 --> 14:39.010
Red, there are more of them.

14:39.010 --> 14:40.150
Right. Let's do this.

14:40.620 --> 14:41.360
Yeah!

14:52.270 --> 14:53.740
They're using martial arts?!

14:54.070 --> 14:56.160
Must be the Divine Blessing 
of the Martial Artist!

14:58.880 --> 14:59.540
Magic?!

15:10.940 --> 15:13.110
And that was the Divine Blessing of the Mage.

15:13.110 --> 15:15.350
I've never seen an ogre king like that!

15:15.350 --> 15:18.400
They have multiple Blessings.

15:18.400 --> 15:20.150
That's just crazy.

15:20.150 --> 15:22.550
But it's the only explanation.

15:36.510 --> 15:38.550
I hope that was the last of them.

15:38.550 --> 15:41.040
Phew. Mission complete.

15:42.880 --> 15:43.970
Huh...

15:44.800 --> 15:47.260
Is this a piece of ancient elven ruins?

15:54.750 --> 15:56.760
Red, what is that?

15:57.010 --> 16:01.150
I don't know what it says, 
but that's ancient elven writing.

16:01.560 --> 16:03.120
Are you sure?

16:03.120 --> 16:06.650
Yeah. I've seen it before, somewhere.

16:06.960 --> 16:11.120
You know, you said they 
had multiple Blessings.

16:11.120 --> 16:13.740
You know what else did? The gem beast.

16:19.650 --> 16:24.510
Maybe the beast was linked to 
ancient elves somehow, too.

16:26.730 --> 16:28.540
Thank you, Sir Hero!

16:28.540 --> 16:29.680
Bye-bye!

16:29.680 --> 16:30.190
Sure.

16:30.190 --> 16:31.010
Bye-bye!

16:31.410 --> 16:32.850
That was fun!

16:33.970 --> 16:35.650
We'll take our leave now.

16:35.650 --> 16:37.440
Before you go, Esta...

16:37.440 --> 16:37.970
Yes?

16:38.460 --> 16:42.770
I've heard that all Heroes have a Guide.

16:42.770 --> 16:46.980
Please stay beside the Hero and 
lead him down the right path.

16:55.280 --> 16:56.350
Sorry I made you wait.

16:56.350 --> 16:57.120
It's fine.

16:57.120 --> 17:00.020
I'm relieved, honestly.

17:00.020 --> 17:00.950
By what?

17:01.620 --> 17:05.250
You used to act like you wanted 
nothing to do with people.

17:05.920 --> 17:11.340
But today, you interacted with the children 
without once complaining about it.

17:11.600 --> 17:15.170
Oh. Those kids haven't 
awakened their Blessings yet.

17:15.680 --> 17:21.850
And kids should be protected until 
they do and understand their roles.

17:22.120 --> 17:24.800
Is that what your Hero's 
Blessing is telling you?

17:25.480 --> 17:27.850
Or is that how you feel?

17:28.130 --> 17:32.910
My feelings are always aligned with 
my Blessing and Lord Demis's will.

17:33.420 --> 17:34.860
That's what makes a Hero.

17:36.640 --> 17:37.570
Is that so?

17:37.990 --> 17:40.370
There you are, Van.

17:40.790 --> 17:43.870
Just who I wanted to see. 
We know where we're headed to next.

17:44.350 --> 17:46.330
She will take us there.

17:46.720 --> 17:49.790
I'm Tisse Garland. 
It's a pleasure to meet you.

17:49.790 --> 17:52.900
She comes with the recommendation 
of the Adventurers' Guild's brass.

17:52.900 --> 17:56.590
They say she's one of the very 
top adventurers in all Zoltan.

17:56.890 --> 18:00.010
I am Escarlata Dias. It's nice to meet you.

18:00.010 --> 18:00.640
And I'm Van—

18:00.640 --> 18:01.800
Wait a second.

18:02.610 --> 18:05.470
You were watching us the 
other night, weren't you?

18:05.470 --> 18:07.890
That's right. I was working 
a second job that night.

18:08.150 --> 18:10.900
One of the very top adventurers 
has a second job?

18:11.170 --> 18:13.290
I'm saving up to go on a hot springs trip.

18:13.290 --> 18:14.430
Hot springs?

18:14.430 --> 18:14.900
Right.

18:15.360 --> 18:17.870
Have you heard of the Camillo hot springs?

18:17.870 --> 18:20.760
It's one of the top three 
hot spring resorts in Avalon,

18:20.760 --> 18:26.160
famous for its heat retention that 
keeps it hot from spring to winter.

18:26.160 --> 18:30.090
It cures shoulder and back pain, 
and also poor circulation in an instant,

18:30.090 --> 18:33.630
and is so popular that prices 
in nearby inns have skyrocketed.

18:33.630 --> 18:38.750
You could build a house in Zoltan with the 
money it costs to stay one night there.

18:40.400 --> 18:42.410
By the way, it's located here.

18:42.410 --> 18:43.600
You don't say?

18:45.120 --> 18:46.800
Whatever.

18:46.800 --> 18:49.040
Who spends money on hot water?

18:49.040 --> 18:50.810
Humans do the stupidest things.

18:53.170 --> 18:53.950
Hmph!

18:56.980 --> 18:59.240
The villagers shared this with us as thanks.

18:59.240 --> 19:00.320
Wow!

19:00.790 --> 19:02.560
This should last us three days!

19:02.560 --> 19:05.280
Curry every day. I love it.

19:05.280 --> 19:07.910
So, do you want to have dinner right away?

19:07.910 --> 19:12.080
Hmm... I want to take a bath first.

19:12.080 --> 19:13.920
I'm all sticky and gross.

19:14.330 --> 19:18.260
I'll get the bath ready, then. You two relax.

19:19.010 --> 19:19.630
No.

19:20.430 --> 19:21.220
Ruti?

19:21.890 --> 19:24.100
You need to rest tonight.

19:24.100 --> 19:26.340
Nah, I'm still fine.

19:27.150 --> 19:30.730
You worked hard today,
so I want to do something for you.

19:31.500 --> 19:34.110
Gotcha. Thanks, Ruti.

19:34.440 --> 19:39.610
I want to do something for you, too, Rit. 
Let's take a bath together.

19:39.930 --> 19:40.670
Huh?

19:50.610 --> 19:52.230
Okay. Let's do the front next.

19:52.230 --> 19:53.210
What?!

19:54.860 --> 19:56.960
Y-You don't mean...

20:00.700 --> 20:01.520
Here I go.

20:09.510 --> 20:10.480
Wait...

20:11.960 --> 20:13.520
How do I do the front, again?

20:13.520 --> 20:14.850
I'll do it myself!

20:16.890 --> 20:21.630
You two always do so much for me, 
so I wanted to show my appreciation.

20:21.630 --> 20:25.370
And there's something 
I haven't said to you yet.

20:25.370 --> 20:26.940
What's that?

20:29.330 --> 20:30.870
Congratulations on your engagement.

20:33.120 --> 20:37.250
Big Brother never had a 
moment's peace on our travels.

20:37.700 --> 20:39.630
But it's different now.

20:40.510 --> 20:44.370
He looks really happy with you.

20:44.880 --> 20:46.060
Ruti...

20:46.860 --> 20:49.640
Yeah, I couldn't be happier myself.

20:50.000 --> 20:54.290
Marrying you will make him even happier.

20:54.290 --> 20:57.940
And that will make <i>me</i> all the more happy.

21:00.650 --> 21:02.150
Ruti!

21:04.880 --> 21:06.220
Listen, Ruti...

21:07.040 --> 21:10.690
You've had to bear such a 
heavy burden for so long.

21:11.600 --> 21:14.160
But it's not just Red anymore.

21:14.950 --> 21:16.640
I'm on your side, too.

21:16.640 --> 21:17.600
Rit...

21:21.520 --> 21:22.550
Thanks.

21:34.480 --> 21:37.970
Sounds like Van's heading out to 
take out Dantak the hill giant.

21:38.770 --> 21:41.940
Tisse will be going with 
him to show him the way.

21:41.940 --> 21:43.060
Tisse?

21:43.060 --> 21:46.330
Yeah. I'm sure she'll be fine,

21:46.330 --> 21:52.450
but if Van finds out she's hiding her 
identity from him, he may consider her an enemy.

21:52.450 --> 21:55.460
Tisse may be strong, but even 
she'd be in danger then.

21:56.140 --> 21:57.270
Mr. Crawly Wawly.

21:58.240 --> 22:01.850
If Tisse's in trouble, come to me.

22:02.450 --> 22:04.700
Be it the Church or the Hero,

22:05.230 --> 22:07.970
I'm not letting anyone hurt my best friend.
